{"data": [{"author_id": "1497541723089944578", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:07:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116894999665099088"], "id": "2116894999665099088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 114, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "自2016年习近平搞独裁开始，中国出生人口7年内减半，而日本花了40年，韩国花了20年。中国如今的出生人口，还包括了脑子里还比较封建的八零后九零后，等00后开始不把传宗接代当回事后，出生人口再次雪崩的可能还在加大，出生人口会远远少于中国抗日时期的最低水平，这样的未来中国怎么可能发展好", "url": "https://x.com/Bob32504385/status/2116894999665099088"}, {"author_id": "1611656170393194497", "created_at": "2026-11-02T08:23:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117170795877453982"], "id": "2117170795877453982", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117149019386580999", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "出生人口断崖式负增长 https://t.co/4B9YO3R99g", "url": "https://x.com/AlanWan76319411/status/2117170795877453982"}, {"author_id": "1359061717414629380", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:18:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117078324237496704", "2117078825205121535"], "id": "2117078825205121535", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 127, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "各国出生人口减半花了多少年 https://t.co/A0k1ZSIPg0", "url": "https://x.com/Ninalvz/status/2117078825205121535"}, {"author_id": "1951064331187372032", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:14:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117258929453556212"], "id": "2117258929453556212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 151, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国新出生人口变化，绘图的人高情商😸 https://t.co/DfCzckIelP", "url": "https://x.com/xianebvjsjj/status/2117258929453556212"}, {"author_id": "1505058790160609282", "created_at": "2026-11-01T01:49:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116709216782336172"], "id": "2116709216782336172", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小学老师转岗教中学，上了热搜。原因不在教育，在出生人口：2016年出生1786万，2024年954万，八年少一半。\n小学在校生2024年已经见顶，之后往下走。老师多出来了，编制不能裁，只能往上挪。初中大概2030年轮到。\n所以“教师是铁饭碗”要改一句：饭碗跟出生人口绑定，人口才是老板。", "url": "https://x.com/waz3923/status/2116709216782336172"}, {"author_id": "1585964743155589141", "created_at": "2026-11-01T00:22:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116687176079675586"], "id": "2116687176079675586", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1850年到2025年美国人口中外国出生人口比例 https://t.co/qCrulZVzIe", "url": "https://x.com/Fc2024K/status/2116687176079675586"}, {"author_id": "2056971245128724480", "created_at": "2026-11-02T15:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117278055379177944"], "id": "2117278055379177944", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "报表界来了个天才\n图一国内出生人口变化 图二是车企销售量 https://t.co/Pz1BDRxKZ9", "url": "https://x.com/Emonvky/status/2117278055379177944"}, {"author_id": "785611716155498500", "created_at": "2026-11-02T03:27:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117096165464576241"], "id": "2117096165464576241", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117053242027004376", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "そんなしゃあないやん。\n\n　出生人口多い「団塊」・「団塊ジュニア」親子世代なんやから！！ https://t.co/U0qc8dDIj6", "url": "https://x.com/SAYAS_DIARY/status/2117096165464576241"}, {"author_id": "1725927523291439104", "created_at": "2026-11-02T05:19:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117124529063698700"], "id": "2117124529063698700", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 575, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "目前新出生人口逐年下降\n\n如果中国人口降到一半\n\n我们会过上好日子吗？", "url": "https://x.com/ming_li90112/status/2117124529063698700"}, {"author_id": "1464536809606631427", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:44:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117236513905991861"], "id": "2117236513905991861", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok根据中国最近20年的出生人口和死亡人口，预测下大概多久中年失业和应届生就业困难的问题能够得到缓解？", "url": "https://x.com/wkussi/status/2117236513905991861"}, {"author_id": "879361093142929408", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:09:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116850214904721438"], "id": "2116850214904721438", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年中国全年出生人口：792万人，出生率5.63‰。全年死亡人口：1131万人，死亡率8.04‰自然增长率：-2.41‰（连续第四年负增长）广东是人口出生第一大省。人口减少真不是坏事。", "url": "https://x.com/Tommy94880575/status/2116850214904721438"}, {"author_id": "1986426163074637827", "created_at": "2026-11-02T10:02:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117195714958905463"], "id": "2117195714958905463", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年中国出生人口792万，比上年少了162万。2025年前三季度结婚登记同比回升8.5%，有人据此预测2026年会反弹到818万到855万。我觉得会小幅回升，但很难超过850万。@grok 准不准？", "url": "https://x.com/58tzwc/status/2117195714958905463"}, {"author_id": "1701105621838483456", "created_at": "2026-11-01T06:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116784805362982934"], "id": "2116784805362982934", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "社保会不会崩盘，我不知道。\n\n但有一件事很确定：\n\n出生人口下降、老龄人口增加、年轻人晚就业，\n\n最后压力不会凭空消失，只会换一种方式落到某一代人身上。\n\n你觉得会落到哪一代？@grok", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoWanxing/status/2116784805362982934"}, {"author_id": "1925108905266544640", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:37:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117234670513652045"], "id": "2117234670513652045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 196, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "卧槽！第一次见到连出生人口都能做出“反向增长”的报表！\n\n2016年出生1786万人，2025年只剩792万人，10年直接打了个对折还不止。\n\n股票反着买，别墅靠大海；报表反着做，升官又发财。\n\n我愿称之为第五大发明：连下降都能画出上升感！ https://t.co/VXZamGDskz", "url": "https://x.com/lushi1447172/status/2117234670513652045"}, {"author_id": "1116665952", "created_at": "2026-11-01T20:43:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116994514137276448"], "id": "2116994514137276448", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 723, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116750988157874572", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "你继续洗吧，按中国人口年鉴，1959-1961总出生人口4233万，到1961人口总数少了1348万，这三年死亡人数是4233+1348=5581万，如果按1956-1958三年平均死亡率来算，1959-1961正常死亡应该只有2000多万，非正常多死了多少人你算不清吗？还是非得秀一下你的智障？ https://t.co/mx337P2CA6", "url": "https://x.com/lihuan888888/status/2116994514137276448"}, {"author_id": "2043207917751463936", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:23:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117321760458866836"], "id": "2117321760458866836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026年前9个月，生育津贴已经砸出781亿，全年预计再破千亿。\n2024年生育保险基金支出一度冲到1403亿的历史峰值，2025年还在1350亿以上高位徘徊。\n钱花得越来越多，出生人口却越来越少。\n是补贴力度不够，还是真正卡住的根本不是这点钱？\n#生育津贴 #低生育率", "url": "https://x.com/Maoerai/status/2117321760458866836"}, {"author_id": "1116665952", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:08:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116895187473690889"], "id": "2116895187473690889", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 611, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "计算三年多死亡人口，1959出生1665万，1960年出生1381万，1961年出生1187万，三年出生人口4233万，而到1961年人口比1959年减少1348万，也就是这三年死亡总人数为4233万加1348万，总共 死亡5581万，在1956到1958平均死亡率是1.14%，按前三年平均死亡率，1959-1961正常死亡应该是1992万左右，多死3589万 https://t.co/ty37w6pGpZ", "url": "https://x.com/lihuan888888/status/2116895187473690889"}, {"author_id": "135732488", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:38:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116857383192506797"], "id": "2116857383192506797", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 165, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116771417639494087", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "最基础的数据是基于《中国统计年鉴1983》吧。\n但那是个80年代特殊背景下的仓促产物。里面记载的1960年出生的人，甚至比2000人口普查还活着的40岁人少100多万，这还不算中途那些病逝或其它原因死亡的。\n出生人口都不准的，死亡人口就必准？\n这就好比基于一错误定理，用它推出的答案全是垃圾进、垃圾出。 https://t.co/7unsg9z5SI", "url": "https://x.com/iviso/status/2116857383192506797"}, {"author_id": "2027341342188388352", "created_at": "2026-11-02T15:26:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117277242254631019"], "id": "2117277242254631019", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "预告：《工作不需要我的日子----中国90后的十五种人生》第三个人物将是1995年出生的上海幼儿园女教师。她曾经工作顺心，家庭稳定，却因出生人口减少、幼儿园缩减规模而失业，目前背着房贷，老公的工作也不乐观，原本幸福的生活突然变得杂乱而迷茫，欢迎朋友们关注支持。#互关 #真诚交友 #永不取关", "url": "https://x.com/heartEmilybb/status/2117277242254631019"}, {"author_id": "1501748415461740547", "created_at": "2026-11-01T03:48:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116739224951259381"], "id": "2116739224951259381", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 326, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "发现一个离谱的现象！💀\n\n全国年轻人都在喊不婚不育\n\n广东却连续8年拿下出生人口第一\n\n结婚登记量也连续4年全国第一！\n\n2025年，广东出生了100多万人，结婚登记超过61万对！\n\n不是说现在年轻人都不想结婚生娃了吗？\n\n广东人到底掌握了什么生存秘籍？！ 🤣\n\n广东的朋友出来解释一下！\n#浇朋友 #蓝V互关", "url": "https://x.com/xingyu_ling/status/2116739224951259381"}, {"author_id": "2108176717982613504", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:10:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117258042601545968"], "id": "2117258042601545968", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 295, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "各位，听我一句劝，最近无论遇到什么事，都先别死！\n\n现在出生率已经低到这个地步了，你以为重新投胎还能回到原来的出生地吗？\n\n去年出生人口最多的是印度，2000多万，后面还有非洲那些国家。说实话，这几个选项摆在面前，估计不少人都得犹豫半天。", "url": "https://x.com/Yang112899/status/2117258042601545968"}, {"author_id": "1952604865856991234", "created_at": "2026-11-01T03:45:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116738290707726539"], "id": "2116738290707726539", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1568, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116668943033405768", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "1960年人口净增长是根据82人口普查里1960年出生人口存活率大于1推算出来的，chenqin就别提了，他写了六篇文章抨击孙经先和杨松林合著的那本“总要有人说出真相”，一开始还能正常推算数据，越往后就越魔怔了，毫无数据分析纯粹挖史料佐证，对官方的一切数字都不信。 https://t.co/eQN2YQ7RWm", "url": "https://x.com/fei22081/status/2116738290707726539"}, {"author_id": "2057322349528064000", "created_at": "2026-11-01T15:55:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116921959141478622"], "id": "2116921959141478622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2940, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "大胆预测，明年民生领域会迎来八降！\n\n第一，房贷利率，楼市去库存，银行抢优质客户，利率还有小幅下行空间，月供压力有望减轻。\n第二，幼儿园费用，出生人口减少，很多民办园招不满，叠加普惠政策，保教费存在下调压力。\n第三，通信资费，运营商内卷，携号转网便利，低价套餐会越来越多。", "url": "https://x.com/OwenJzhlYzll/status/2116921959141478622"}, {"author_id": "2111628631885926400", "created_at": "2026-11-01T05:58:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116771913490104478"], "id": "2116771913490104478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一年出生792万人，年轻人为何越来越不愿结婚生子？\n\n每逢过年，很多年轻人最怕的不是走亲戚，而是长辈反复追问：“什么时候结婚？什么时候生孩子？”\n\n在老一辈眼里，结婚生子是人生必经之路。可如今，越来越多年轻人面对这些问题，却显得十分淡定，甚至把“不婚不育”当成一种生活选择。", "url": "https://x.com/Fffwrpl/status/2116771913490104478"}, {"author_id": "604525447", "created_at": "2026-11-02T07:50:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117162308560699767"], "id": "2117162308560699767", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "引用的国家统计局数据：2025 年出生人口 792 万人，出生率 5.63‰，比 2024 年少了 162 万人；2016 年还是 1786 万人，十年降了 55.7%。同时死亡 1131 万人，自然增长率 -2.41‰。它把原因归到三块：育龄妇女减少、家庭养育成本高、就业和收入预期不稳，结论是政策要从“鼓励生”转向“降低养育约束”。", "url": "https://x.com/ligen00/status/2117162308560699767"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1497541723089944578", "name": "Bob", "username": "Bob32504385"}, {"id": "1611656170393194497", "name": "Можно", "username": "AlanWan76319411"}, {"id": "1359061717414629380", "name": "Nina", "username": "Ninalvz"}, {"id": "1951064331187372032", "name": "胖虎的日常", "username": "xianebvjsjj"}, {"id": "1505058790160609282", "name": "蒲巴", "username": "waz3923"}, {"id": "1585964743155589141", "name": "狼哥", "username": "Fc2024K"}, {"id": "2056971245128724480", "name": "Emon", "username": "Emonvky"}, {"id": "785611716155498500", "name": "SAYA’S DIARY", "username": "SAYAS_DIARY"}, {"id": "1725927523291439104", "name": "脱鞋走路", "username": "ming_li90112"}, {"id": "1464536809606631427", "name": "野生树莓", "username": "wkussi"}, {"id": "879361093142929408", "name": "Quant Uncle", "username": "Tommy94880575"}, {"id": "1986426163074637827", "name": "ddfxs", "username": "58tzwc"}, {"id": "1701105621838483456", "name": "万星Vincent", "username": "CryptoWanxing"}, {"id": "1925108905266544640", "name": "blueberry", "username": "lushi1447172"}, {"id": "1116665952", "name": "李逍遥", "username": "lihuan888888"}, {"id": "2043207917751463936", "name": "猫儿不偷腥 Dr.", "username": "Maoerai"}, {"id": "135732488", "name": "Jun Lu", "username": "iviso"}, {"id": "2027341342188388352", "name": "Emily-NotesOnBeing", "username": "heartEmilybb"}, {"id": "1501748415461740547", "name": "小师猜想", "username": "xingyu_ling"}, {"id": "2108176717982613504", "name": "在见已是三楼", "username": "Yang112899"}, {"id": "1952604865856991234", "name": "金江南", "username": "fei22081"}, {"id": "2057322349528064000", "name": "欧文owen", "username": "OwenJzhlYzll"}, {"id": "2111628631885926400", "name": "Fff", "username": "Fffwrpl"}, {"id": "604525447", "name": "Jimmy Lee", "username": "ligen00"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117321760458866836", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzly3cal3og9hraqlsm6ys03cghod", "oldest_id": "2116687176079675586", "result_count": 25}}
